/* -----------------------------------------------------------------------
   A note on the automation model (see Automation Control Center below):
   every workflow acts on data the school actively exports or enters into
   SAGE. None of them simulate logging into a third-party ERP (Vidyalaya /
   Fedena / etc.) on the school's behalf -- doing so, even with a
   school-supplied password, would bypass that vendor's own access
   controls. Government registry sync (APAAR / DigiLocker) is likewise
   modelled as an official, registered Issuer integration, never a scrape.
------------------------------------------------------------------------ */

